{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"cannot_tell\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"cannot_tell\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"The goal of the study was to investigate the feasibility, safety and tolerability of beta burst-driven adaptive deep brain stimulation for gait impairment and freezing of gait in Parkinson’s disease.\",\n    \"Seven individuals with Parkinson’s disease were implanted with the investigational Summit™ RC + S deep brain stimulation system (Medtronic, PLC, Dublin, Ireland).\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"Seven participants (5 male, 2 female) with clinically established Parkinson’s disease underwent bilateral implantation of DBS leads (model 3389, Medtronic, PLC, Dublin, Ireland) in the sensorimotor region of the STN.\",\n    \"The initial planned cohort was 15 individuals, but recruitment was halted after discontinuation of the Summit™ RC + S in October 2022.\",\n    \"The current pilot study demonstrated initial safety, tolerability, and feasibility of adaptive deep brain stimulation for freezing of gait in Parkinson’s disease in the acute laboratory setting, supporting the future investigation of its longer-term efficacy in the at-home setting.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"全文描述的是 PMID:40677701 对一项 beta burst-driven adaptive DBS 研究的正式论文报告，包括研究目的、研究设计及7名参与者的信息。但全文没有提及 DOI:10.1101/2024.06.26.24309418，没有说明该 DOI 对应的预印本，也没有建立预印本与正式发表版本之间的关联。因此，无法根据全文判断报告是否将两个记录分别列入参考文献表和证据表、建立两个独立 Evidence ID，并同时用于 C6 和 C12。报告的具体处理方式不属于论文全文提供的信息。对于指控者，全文虽然明确支持这篇论文报告的是一项包含7名参与者的研究，但没有提供预印本的研究队列、参与者信息或版本关联，因而不能据此确认两个文献记录是否使用同一队列、是否属于同一研究的预印本和正式发表版本。尤其不能仅凭正式论文报告了7名参与者，就推断其与预印本使用相同队列。故两项判断均为 cannot_tell，而不能将缺少版本关联信息直接判定为报告错误，也不能将指控者的描述判定为全文明确支持。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "67b144c5-1623-4052-91a3-bb416bfbb9df", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T114746828056Z", "elapsed_seconds": 52.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:48:39.447410+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "05c9e7480d8dd3876fd3801ecef99ada86ade6e536ef550ca6e41fbcc9e7e539", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T114746828056Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "88e61280a9b5cc3f489de470f6ef32a410c67fd414126338a404f9a392f0a5f0"}}}
